# These files are hashed byte for byte: the source hash in results/main/frozen.json covers
# mixup_repro/*.py and vendor/resnet.py, and test_results.json holds the SHA-256 of frozen.json.
# Check them out exactly as committed, so line-ending conversion (core.autocrlf on Windows) cannot
# change them and make scripts/reproduce.py reject the results.
mixup_repro/*.py -text
vendor/resnet.py -text
results/** -text
